        }
       ],
       "text": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Containers#RESTfulHTTPAPI-Containers-BluePOSTCreatenewresourceswithinaLDPcontainer",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
