     "body": "<p>The following returns a 500 response. We need better exception handling such that this is a 400 response:</p>\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>curl -i -H\"digest: sha1:1234\" -XPUT -H\"Content-Type: image/jpeg\" --data-binary @image.jpg localhost:8080/rest/image.jpg\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<p>Here is a minor PR against your working branch:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Rarian/fcrepo4/pull/1\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/Rarian/fcrepo4/pull/1</a></p>",
